# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Discovery output — NEVER commit this.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runs write to <OutputRoot>\Discover-WindowsServer_<COMPUTERNAME>_<timestamp>\
# (default OutputRoot is C:\Temp, i.e. outside the repo). But -OutputRoot . would
# land it here, and that output contains real client infrastructure data: share
# paths, ACLs, service accounts, listening ports, event-log samples, and the
# evidence archive. It is a client deliverable, not source.
Discover-WindowsServer_*/
/csv/
/json/
/html/
/markdown/
/raw/
/evidence/
/archive/
/logs/
/status/
/client-safe/
/internal/
workbook.xml
internal-report.html
collection-metadata.json
errors.txt
warnings.txt
limitations.txt
scoping-risks.txt
discovery-verification-report.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local branding config — a machine's own real client-facing brand name and
# logo. The GUI now saves these to %ProgramData%\Discover-WindowsServer\branding;
# config\ is the pre-move location (still read as a fallback) and where fleet
# runs stage them on targets, so never let them into git from here either.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
config/branding.local.json
config/branding-logo.*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Windows / OneDrive cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk
# OneDrive / Office lock files
~$*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and tooling
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Transient
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.log
